</div>
<div class="sc-hero-band" data-hana-bg="flow" data-variant="light" data-fade="none" style="background:#fff;position:relative;z-index:1;overflow:hidden;"><img src="~/images/circuit-board-blue.png" aria-hidden="true" style="position:absolute;top:15px;right:-80px;width:300px;height:300px;opacity:0.4;pointer-events:none;z-index:0;user-select:none;transform:rotate(8deg);" /><div style="position:relative;z-index:1;max-width:1000px;margin:0 auto;padding:56px 48px 40px;"><div style="margin-bottom:64px;">
    <div style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:10px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--hana-blue);margin-bottom:14px;">DFx &amp; JDM Collaboration · JDM</div>
    <h1 style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:46px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.06;letter-spacing:-0.03em;margin:0 0 18px;max-width:740px;text-wrap:balance;">Joint Development Model (JDM)</h1>
    <p style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:18px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.55;max-width:660px;margin:0 0 32px;text-wrap:pretty;">A development model where your team and ours build the product together — shared definition, co-engineering and a common roadmap, so the design and the process mature side by side.</p>
